{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/b710ccd33ca8f07555a4d6fccd29271c.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/b710ccd33ca8f07555a4d6fccd29271c.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the life of DAWG, a streamer who streams... well, when he can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/7c011c08730ffb8b4905783c9eefd769.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/7c011c08730ffb8b4905783c9eefd769.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every day begins with important household tasks: Playing on the phone, warming your feet in the basin, calling your mom... and only when all this is done... cut the stream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not that simple. There is a much more complicated and exciting story behind these everyday rituals:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >START A STREAMING CAREER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/b306c56d82efeb8fb0f654248370731f.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/b306c56d82efeb8fb0f654248370731f.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PICK UP THE MONEY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/71aea9bebce4686f4a3043b5bb235a04.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/71aea9bebce4686f4a3043b5bb235a04.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKE NEW FRIENDS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/c6e2b6f879e2d0be6f1ff5d4aff6afda.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/c6e2b6f879e2d0be6f1ff5d4aff6afda.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GET MARRIED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/dfcc870169c8cd2e34988b008c9101bd.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/dfcc870169c8cd2e34988b008c9101bd.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >START A HAPPY LIFE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/d2624577cab96e536ebcfd506188010b.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/d2624577cab96e536ebcfd506188010b.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND MAKE SURE THAT THE NEXT SCHIZO THEORY IS TRUE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/8e131ac4684369018e2da00392179014.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/8e131ac4684369018e2da00392179014.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAWG GAME is a comedic adventure with cozy low\u2014poly graphics and a variety of mini-games. Each level changes the rules of the game \u2014 you won't get bored! All this is in the spirit of Dawgostan culture and local humor, which every inhabitant of the chat of their favorite streamer will understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720760?t=1766246570","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720760?t=1766246570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/424f2cce4f5d4d19827c1a4e6623ce6e688fb3c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766246570","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/424f2cce4f5d4d19827c1a4e6623ce6e688fb3c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766246570","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The player must consume alcohol and cigarettes throughout the game level.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/b710ccd33ca8f07555a4d6fccd29271c.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras_big/b710ccd33ca8f07555a4d6fccd29271c.avif?t=1766246570 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the life of DAWG, a streamer who streams... well, when he can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720760/extras/7c011c08730ffb8b4905783c9eefd769.avif?t=1766246570\" data-big-src=https://shared.aka